 query. The token extractor deliberately reads a bearer header. Correcting the parameter location aligns documentation with the authentication design.\"},{\"item_id\":\"V22\",\"L1\":\"UNDECIDABLE\",\"confidence\":3,\"evidence_locators\":\"V22/contract/rest-api/resources/src/main/resources/openapi/deviceEvent/deviceEvent-scopeId-deviceId-_query.yaml:32; V22/contract/rest-api/resources/src/main/resources/openapi/deviceEvent/deviceEvent.yaml:44; V22/impl/service/device/api/src/main/java/org/eclipse/kapua/service/device/management/message/KapuaMethod.java:101\",\"rationale\":\"The query response schema gives action only type string, without an enum. SUBMIT therefore does not contradict the supplied contract. The asserted restriction cannot ground an artifact-level fault.\"},{\"item_id\":\"V23\",\"L1\":\"IMPL\",\"confidence\":2,\"evidence_locators\":\"V23/contract/swatch-contracts/src/main/resources/META-INF/openapi.yaml:469; V23/contract/swatch-contracts/src/main/resources/META-INF/openapi.yaml:1251; V23/contract/swatch-contracts/src/main/resources/META-INF/openapi.yaml:1904; V23/impl/swatch-contracts/src/main/java/com/redhat/swatch/contract/resource/DefaultExceptionMapper.java:65\",\"rationale\":\"⚠️ The sync operation declares the Errors envelope for default JSON failures. The generic exception mapper serializes an unwrapped Error; its entity lacks the required errors array.\"},{\"item_id\":\"V24\",\"L1\":\"IMPL\",\"confidence\":2,\"evidence_locators\":\"V24/contract/swatch-contracts/src/main/resources/META-INF/openapi.yaml:195; V24/contract/swatch-contracts/src/main/resources/META-INF/openapi.yaml:1251; V24/contract/swatch-contracts/src/main/resources/META-INF/openapi.yaml:1904; V24/impl/swatch-contracts/src/main/java/com/redhat/swatch/contract/resource/DefaultExceptionMapper.java:65\",\"rationale\":\"⚠️ The operation's ErrorResponse requires an errors array. The exception mapper builds a single Error entity instead. The implementation omits the explicitly specified response envelope.\"},{\"item_id\":\"V25\",\"L1\":\"IMPL\",\"confidence\":2,\"evidence_locators\":\"V25/contract/swatch-contracts/src/main/resources/META-INF/openapi.yaml:30; V25/contract/swatch-contracts/src/main/resources/META-INF/openapi.yaml:1251; V25/contract/swatch-contracts/src/main/resources/META-INF/openapi.yaml:1904; V25/impl/swatch-contracts/src/main/java/com/redhat/swatch/contract/resource/ContractsExceptionMapper.java:44\",\"rationale\":\"⚠️ The delete operation declares Errors for default failures. The contracts exception mapper supplies one Error directly, including for CONTRACT_DOES_NOT_EXIST. That response omits the declared required errors array.\"},{\"item_id\":\"V26\",\"L1\":\"SPEC\",\"confidence\":2,\"evidence_locators\":\"V26/contract/rest-api/resources/src/main/resources/openapi/authentication/authentication.yaml:54; V26/impl/service/security/authentication/api/src/main/java/org/eclipse/kapua/service/authentication/token/LoginInfo.java:38; V26/impl/rest-api/core/src/main/java/org/eclipse/kapua/app/api/core/MoxyJsonConfigContextResolver.java:25\",\"rationale\":\"⚠️ The serialization interface explicitly assigns singular collection names and supplies no plural wrappers. The contract pluralizes three of those properties while retaining singular accessPermission, suggesting documentation drift rather than unintended serialization.\"},{\"item_id\":\"V27\",\"L1\":\"SPEC\",\"confidence\":2,\"evidence_locators\":\"V27/contract/spec/api.json:718; V27/impl/selfservice/strategy/idfirst/strategy_login.go:188; V27/impl/selfservice/flow/login/handler.go:698\",\"rationale\":\"⚠️ The strategy deliberately assigns username webauthn to identifier inputs, and flow retrieval returns the stored flow. The enum omits that purposeful UI attribute value, so the specification appears incomplete.\"},{\"item_id\":\"V28\",\"L1\":\"IMPL\",\"confidence\":2,\"evidence_locators\":\"V28/contract/src/main/resources/api-specs/product-openapi.yaml:95; V28/impl/src/main/java/com/zufar/icedlatte/product/api/PageableProductsProvider.java:31; V28/impl/src/main/java/com/zufar/icedlatte/product/api/PageableProductsProvider.java:44; V28/impl/src/main/java/com/zufar/icedlatte/common/exception/handler/GlobalExceptionHandler.java:20; V28/impl/src/main/java/com/zufar/icedlatte/product/exception/handler/ProductExceptionHandler.java:22\",\"rationale\":\"⚠️ Arbitrary sort attributes reach repository.findAll through Sort.by without validation. Supplied advice handles validation and missing products, not invalid repository properties. This leaves invalid sort requests outside the promised 400 handling.\"},{\"item_id\":\"V29\",\"L1\":\"IMPL\",\"confidence\":3,\"evidence_locators\":\"V29/contract/src/main/resources/openapi.json:548; V29/impl/src/main/java/io/strimzi/kafka/bridge/http/HttpSinkBridgeEndpoint.java:357; V29/impl/src/main/java/io/strimzi/kafka/bridge/SinkBridgeEndpoint.java:270\",\"rationale\":\"⚠️ doAssign appends partition assignments and invokes assign without checking an existing topic subscription. Neither this path nor its callback implements the documented 409 conflict response.\"},{\"item_id\":\"V30\",\"L1\":\"IMPL\",\"confidence\":3,\"evidence_locators\":\"V30/contract/docs/api.swagger.json:3082; V30/contract/docs/api.swagger.json:3175; V30/impl/oauth2/handler.go:229; V30/impl/driver/configuration/provider_viper.go:370\",\"rationale\":\"⚠️ Discovery fields have distinct claim and scope meanings, corroborated by the configuration providers. The handler assigns the scope provider to ClaimsSupported and the claim provider to ScopesSupported, reversing their intended mappings.\"},{\"item_id\":\"V31\",\"L1\":\"UNDECIDABLE\",\"confidence\":1,\"evidence_locators\":\"V31/contract/src/main/resources/openapi.json:102; V31/impl/src/main/java/io/strimzi/kafka/bridge/http/HttpBridge.java:168; V31/impl/src/main/java/io/strimzi/kafka/bridge/http/HttpSinkBridgeEndpoint.java:181; V31/impl/src/main/java/io/strimzi/kafka/bridge/http/HttpSinkBridgeEndpoint.java:500\",\"rationale\":\"The endpoint consumes partition input, and CORS installs a root handler. The supplied package omits RouterBuilder internals needed to establish loss of automatic body parsing. The proposition alone cannot prove that consequence.\"},{\"item_id\":\"V32\",\"L1\":\"IMPL\",\"confidence\":2,\"evidence_locators\":\"V32/contract/swatch-contracts/src/main/resources/META-INF/openapi.yaml:444; V32/contract/swatch-contracts/src/main/resources/META-INF/openapi.yaml:1251; V32/contract/swatch-contracts/src/main/resources/META-INF/openapi.yaml:1904; V32/impl/swatch-contracts/src/main/java/com/redhat/swatch/contract/resource/SubscriptionsExceptionMapper.java:42; V32/impl/swatch-contracts/src/main/java/com/redhat/swatch/contract/resource/DefaultExceptionMapper.java:65\",\"rationale\":\"⚠️ UMB subscription errors are documented through Errors with a required array. The exception mappers serialize a single Error entity, so their output omits the prescribed envelope.\"},{\"item_id\":\"V33\",\"L1\":\"SPEC\",\"confidence\":2,\"evidence_locators\":\"V33/contract/spec/api.json:723; V33/impl/selfservice/strategy/idfirst/strategy_login.go:188; V33/impl/selfservice/flow/login/handler.go:219\",\"rationale\":\"⚠️ Browser login deliberately populates identifier-first nodes whose autocomplete is username webauthn. The narrow schema enum excludes this purposeful feature value; the specification should describe the supported attribute.\"},{\"item_id\":\"V34\",\"L1\":\"IMPL\",\"confidence\":3,\"evidence_locators\":\"V34/contract/app/src/main/resources-unfiltered/META-INF/resources/api-specifications/registry/v3/openapi.json:2686; V34/impl/app/src/main/java/io/apicurio/registry/rest/v3/impl/AbstractResourceImpl.java:131; V34/impl/app/src/main/java/io/apicurio/registry/rest/v3/impl/GroupsResourceImpl.java:968\",\"rationale\":\"⚠️ Rewritten references must retrieve referenced content. The URL builder omits /content and targets the version metadata resource, whose handler returns VersionMetaData. The implementation chooses the wrong endpoint.\"},{\"item_id\":\"V35\",\"L1\":\"IMPL\",\"confidence\":3,\"evidence_locators\":\"V35/contract/src/main/resources/openapi.json:2257; V35/contract/src/main/resources/openapi.json:724; V35/impl/src/main/java/io/strimzi/kafka/bridge/http/converter/HttpBinaryMessageConverter.java:46\",\"rationale\":\"⚠️ Base64 binary data needs a string representation. The converter decodes asText without rejecting object/array nodes, allowing silent empty-byte conversion instead of the documented invalid-record handling.\"},{\"item_id\":\"V36\",\"L1\":\"IMPL\",\"confidence\":2,\"evidence_locators\":\"V36/contract/swatch-contracts/src/main/resources/META-INF/openapi.yaml:98; V36/contract/swatch-contracts/src/main/resources/META-INF/openapi.yaml:1251; V36/contract/swatch-contracts/src/main/resources/META-INF/openapi.yaml:1904; V36/impl/swatch-contracts/src/main/java/com/redhat/swatch/contract/resource/DefaultExceptionMapper.java:65\",\"rationale\":\"⚠️ The contract-list operation declares Errors for default responses. The general exception mapper emits Error directly; the declared required errors array is absent.\"},{\"item_id\":\"V37\",\"L1\":\"SPEC\",\"confidence\":3,\"evidence_locators\":\"V37/contract/.schema/api.swagger.json:683; V37/impl/selfservice/strategy/password/login.go:29; V37/impl/selfservice/strategy/password/login.go:63; V37/impl/selfservice/strategy/password/login.go:176\",\"rationale\":\"⚠️ Route registration and generated login forms independently use POST for credential submission. Only the Swagger annotation and derived contract advertise GET, identifying a documentation method error.\"},{\"item_id\":\"V38\",\"L1\":\"IMPL\",\"confidence\":2,\"evidence_locators\":\"V38/contract/swatch-contracts/src/main/resources/META-INF/openapi.yaml:259; V38/contract/swatch-contracts/src/main/resources/META-INF/openapi.yaml:1251; V38/contract/swatch-contracts/src/main/resources/META-INF/openapi.yaml:1904; V38/impl/swatch-contracts/src/main/java/com/redhat/swatch/contract/resource/ContractsExceptionMapper.java:44; V38/impl/swatch-contracts/src/main/java/com/redhat/swatch/contract/resource/DefaultExceptionMapper.java:65\",\"rationale\":\"⚠️ The partner-contract operation references the Errors envelope for default failures. Both relevant exception mappers construct bare Error entities, omitting the explicitly required errors array.\"},{\"item_id\":\"V39\",\"L1\":\"IMPL\",\"confidence\":2,\"evidence_locators\":\"V39/contract/rest-api/resources/src/main/resources/openapi/serviceConfiguration/serviceConfiguration-scopeId.yaml:79; V39/impl/rest-api/resources/src/main/java/org/eclipse/kapua/app/api/resources/v1/resources/ServiceConfigurations.java:82; V39/impl/commons-rest/errors/src/main/java/org/eclipse/kapua/commons/rest/errors/ThrowableMapper.java:37\",\"rationale\":\"⚠️ The update dereferences the account lookup without checking for absence. A null result produces an exception handled as server error, bypassing the supplied entity-not-found mapping and the documented 404 behavior.\"},{\"item_id\":\"V40\",\"L1\":\"IMPL\",\"confidence\":3,\"evidence_locators\":\"V40/contract/api/rhsm-subscriptions-api-spec.yaml:1703; V40/impl/src/main/java/org/candlepin/subscriptions/resource/InstancesResource.java:215; V40/impl/swatch-core/src/main/java/org/candlepin/subscriptions/db/model/TallyInstanceView.java:78; V40/impl/swatch-core/src/main/java/org/candlepin/subscriptions/db/model/InstanceMonthlyTotalKey.java:45\",\"rationale\":\"⚠️ Stored totals are keyed by month and unit, but response construction takes an arbitrary first total only for the row's unit and zeros every other requested unit. It fails to select the corresponding measurement totals.\"}]''')
report=json.loads(r'''\"# Blind labeller L4 — M1 প্রতিবেদন\\n\\n## পদ্ধতি\\n\\nপ্রথম shell command ছিল "'`cat TASK_M1.md`। এরপর অনুমোদিত `../../../09_collab/PROTOCOL.md` এবং `items.csv` পড়েছি। এই task-এর বিশেষ অনুমোদন অনুযায়ী COLLAB_BOARD বা coordinator task পড়িনি। পর্যালোচনার ভিত্তি ছিল প্রতিটি row-এর proposition ও সেই item-এর নিজস্ব contract/implementation; proposition-কে প্রমাণ হিসেবে ধরা হয়নি। সূত্র: `TASK_M1.md`, “Supervisor authorization”, “The items”, “Rules”।'"\\n\\nপ্রতিটি item স্বাধীনভাবে বিচার করেছি; অন্য item-এর source দিয়ে কোনো সিদ্ধান্ত সমর্থন করিনি। Schema reference, handler, serializer annotation, parameter lookup এবং exception mapping অনুসরণ করেছি। যেখানে intended behavior সম্পর্কে সিদ্ধান্ত সরাসরি লেখা নেই, rationale-এ ⚠️ দিয়ে inference চিহ্নিত করেছি। শুধু mismatch পাওয়া মানেই implementation ভুল—এমন নিয়ম ব্যবহার করিনি। প্রতিটি label-এর সূত্র "'`labels_L4.csv`-এর সংশ্লিষ্ট `item_id` row-তে রয়েছে।'"\\n\\n## Label distribution\\n\\n"'`labels_L4.csv`-এর ৪০টি data row গণনা:'"\\n\\n| L1 | সংখ্যা |\\n|---|---:|\\n| SPEC | 10 |\\n| IMPL | 24 |\\n| TEST | 0 |\\n| ENV | 0 |\\n| UNDECIDABLE | 6 |\\n| মোট | 40 |\\n\\nConfidence 1 হলো কম, 2 মাঝারি এবং 3 বেশি। UNDECIDABLE-এর confidence সিদ্ধান্তটির নিশ্চয়তা বোঝায়; কোনো অনুপস্থিত defect-এর নিশ্চয়তা নয়। সব label "'`items.csv`-এর ক্রমে একবার করে দেওয়া হয়েছে; rationale-এর সর্বোচ্চ দৈর্ঘ্য ৩৬ শব্দ। সূত্র: `labels_L4.csv`, row V01–V40।'"\\n\\n## কঠিন সিদ্ধান্ত\\n\\n- **V02:** proposition action-এর ছয়টি অনুমোদিত মান দাবি করলেও contract-এ action শুধু string; enum আসলে responseCode-এর। তাই দাবি করা mismatch প্রতিষ্ঠিত হয়নি এবং UNDECIDABLE দিয়েছি। সূত্র: "'`V02/contract/rest-api/resources/src/main/resources/openapi/deviceEvent/deviceEvent.yaml:44`; `labels_L4.csv`, row V02। V07 ও V22-এর পৃথক পর্যালোচনার ব্যাখ্যা তাদের নিজস্ব CSV row-তে আছে।'"\\n- **V04 ও V12:** ⚠️ positive duration গ্রহণকারী parser এবং expiration interval-এর বর্ণনা দেখে regex-কে অতিরিক্ত সংকীর্ণ মনে হয়েছে। Integer-only syntax-এর স্বাধীন business justification নেই। তাই SPEC, confidence 2; parser-ই ভুল—এ সম্ভাবনা পুরোপুরি বাদ দেওয়া যায় না। পৃথক প্রমাণ: "'`labels_L4.csv`, row V04 ও V12।'"\\n- **V05:** ⚠️ singular endpoint description ও একটিমাত্র JsonDatastoreMessage তৈরির স্পষ্ট code collection schema reference-কে specification error হিসেবে চিহ্নিত করার পক্ষে শক্তিশালী প্রমাণ। সূত্র: "'`V05/contract/rest-api/resources/src/main/resources/openapi/dataMessage/dataMessage-scopeId-datastoreMessageId.yaml:26`; `V05/impl/rest-api/resources/src/main/java/org/eclipse/kapua/app/api/resources/v1/resources/DataMessagesJson.java:202`।'"\\n- **V13:** ⚠️ required errors array-কে intended response structure ধরে bare Error entity-কে implementation defect বলেছি। Runtime failure trace না থাকায় confidence 2। নির্দিষ্ট operation service exception ধরে response detail-ও ফেরায়; তাই প্রতিটি failure একই mapper দিয়ে যায়—এ দাবি করিনি। সূত্র: "'`V13/contract/swatch-contracts/src/main/resources/META-INF/openapi.yaml:1251`; `V13/impl/swatch-contracts/src/main/java/com/redhat/swatch/contract/resource/SubscriptionsExceptionMapper.java:42`; `V13/impl/swatch-contracts/src/main/java/com/redhat/swatch/contract/resource/ContractsResource.java:323`।'"\\n- **V16:** ⚠️ identifier-first strategy ইচ্ছাকৃতভাবে username webauthn বসায়; enum-কে অসম্পূর্ণ specification বলেছি। Feature value সরিয়ে implementation বদলানোকে intended সমাধান ধরে নিইনি। সূত্র: "'`V16/contract/spec/api.json:718`; `V16/impl/selfservice/strategy/idfirst/strategy_login.go:188`।'"\\n- **V19:** CORS root handler দেখা যায়, কিন্তু RouterBuilder-এর নিজস্ব body-processing implementation package-এ নেই। তাই CORS body parsing বন্ধ করে—এই causal assertion যাচাই করা যায়নি; UNDECIDABLE, confidence 1। সূত্র: "'`V19/impl/src/main/java/io/strimzi/kafka/bridge/http/HttpBridge.java:143`, একই file-এর line 168 ও 286। V20 ও V31-এর সিদ্ধান্তও তাদের নিজস্ব package পরীক্ষা করে নেওয়া হয়েছে; পৃথক সূত্র CSV-তে।'"\\n- **V21 ও V37:** ⚠️ authentication header extraction এবং POST route/form-এর স্পষ্ট design যথাক্রমে parameter-location ও HTTP-method documentation error নির্ধারণে সহায়ক হয়েছে। পৃথক প্রমাণ: "'`labels_L4.csv`, row V21 ও V37।'"\\n- **V40:** ⚠️ monthly totals map-এর key-তে month ও unit থাকলেও response builder প্রথম value বেছে নেয় এবং অন্য unit-এ zero দেয়। এটি যথাযথ total নির্বাচন না করার implementation defect হিসেবে বিচার করেছি। সূত্র: "'`V40/impl/src/main/java/org/candlepin/subscriptions/resource/InstancesResource.java:215`; `V40/impl/swatch-core/src/main/java/org/candlepin/subscriptions/db/model/InstanceMonthlyTotalKey.java:45`।'"\\n\\n## সীমাবদ্ধতা\\n\\nএই package-এ runtime exchange ও VCS history অনুপস্থিত; কাজের নির্ধারিত scope-ও তাই। কোনো network access, external tool source, codebook বা intent tool ব্যবহার করিনি; item source চালানো, compile/build, Docker, Java বা Maven ব্যবহার করিনি। শুধু নিজস্ব standard-library Python দিয়ে file reading, CSV writing ও output validation করেছি। সূত্র: "'`TASK_M1.md`, “The items”, “No execution”, “Tools”।'"\\n\\n⚠️ Static analysis থেকে HTTP outcome ও intended behavior-এর attribution সব ক্ষেত্রে সমানভাবে নিশ্চিত নয়। Framework defaults, deployment configuration বা সংরক্ষিত data-এর পূর্ণ অবস্থা ছাড়া কিছু causal assertion যাচাই করা সম্ভব হয়নি। Confidence ও rationale-এ সেই সীমা রাখা হয়েছে; বিশেষত row V19, V20, V31 এবং মাঝারি-confidence সিদ্ধান্তগুলি দেখুন ("'`labels_L4.csv`)। TEST বা ENV-কে দায়ী করার মতো স্বতন্ত্র প্রমাণ পাওয়া যায়নি; count শূন্য হওয়া সেই artifact-গুলির সামগ্রিক শুদ্ধতার দাবি নয়।'"\\n\\nCSV validation-এ header, ৪০টি unique item, মূল order, বৈধ L1 ও confidence, rationale-এর ৪০-শব্দসীমা এবং প্রতিটি evidence locator-এর নিজস্ব item-এর বিদ্যমান file/line পরীক্ষা করা হয়েছে। এই validation item source execution নয়। চূড়ান্ত outputs: "'`labels_L4.csv` এবং `report_L4.md`।'"\\n\\n## Boundary incidents\\n\\nকোনো accidental boundary access ঘটেনি। অনুমোদিত protocol ছাড়া এই directory-এর বাইরে কোনো project material খোলা, list বা search করা হয়নি। অন্য labeller-এর label/report, COLLAB_BOARD, coordinator task এবং অন্য project copy পড়িনি। Search-এ explicit item paths ব্যবহার করেছি; source snippet ছাপার আগে credential-looking ও attribution line redaction প্রয়োগ করেছি। Write সীমা ছিল এই directory-এর দুই নির্ধারিত output file। সূত্র: "'`TASK_M1.md`, “Boundary”, “Privacy”, “Writing”; এই পর্যালোচনার tool-use নথি।'"\\n\"''')
